,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.000086507,"data":"How to read this\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.00009086,"data":"----------------\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.000094864,"data":"cross-rho \u003e 0 with p \u003c 0.05 and frac+ well above 0.5\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.000100037,"data":"    reliability predicts influence across views. DER-MIL's central claim holds\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.000105083,"data":"    and DER-MIL is the proposed model; MR-MIL is its ablation.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.000118864,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.000122644,"data":"cross-rho ~ 0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.000126413,"data":"    the mechanism does not order evidence usefully. MR-MIL becomes the honest\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.000130622,"data":"    proposal and the reliability head becomes a reported negative result.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.000133984,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.000137349,"data":"cross-rho \u003c 0\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.000140698,"data":"    the mechanism is inverted. Worth one look at the reliability head's sign\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.000145132,"data":"    before concluding, then report as a negative result.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.000149345,"data":"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.00015292,"data":"If the region profile shows high mean R where mean |dp| is near zero, that also\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.000157228,"data":"confirms the old -0.75 was the region confound rather than a model failure.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":1430.000161928,"data":"\n"}
